{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Player airship slips.","id":"863743873411317800","name":"the-golden-voice","position":159,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Memory is a strange thing.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:01:52.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304429801709608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'And then that's it. As far as reliable memory goes, my life started just a few months ago. All I have before that is faint wisps, and knowledge of how to do some things.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:01:54.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304438643306566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I understand why, now. But it's still a strange thing to think about.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:02:11.969000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304510407856188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she looks hesitant for a second, and turns to Irynx. '...I suppose I should tell you the full story.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:03:23.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304810480943144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I would like to hear it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:03:45.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304902491394149","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Roy grabs Sabrine's hand and nods.","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:03:46.786000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304908099174410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Telling stories is how a person survives, you know.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:03:55.654000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304945294258186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she smiles at him for a second and squeezes his hand. 'Yeah. How she survives...'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:04:17.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305037464084530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Ed's gonna outlive us all, then.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:04:25.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305069147861022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Of that I have no doubt.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:05:35.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305366083612692","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"(I don't think Roy knows Hope's also an Ed, but tbh both would fit here)","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:06:23.901000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305567087239228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she takes a deep breath. 'It was... I'm not sure how long ago, probably five to ten years. I was fifteen at the time. Not a frog, not a zombie, just... human-passing, if not human.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:06:34.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305613274906674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"You were Sab.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:06:54.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305695495856138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'My little sister... I still can't remember her real name, but I've taken to calling her Katrine... was two.'\nshe stops for a second. 'Name-wise, I don't know if I was. I could easily have taken that name later. But I agree with your point - I was me.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:07:44.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879305906179940372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'We were... at our home, in the forest. Our parents had gone to the nearby town. I left Katrine alone for a minute to make some food, and... coyotes came.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:08:55.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879306201014337566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she starts to choke up slightly, it's clear this is a tough place to move past.","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:09:15.426000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879306286515257375","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Do you remember the feeling?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:10:39.636000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879306639717576735","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Fear.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:10:49.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879306679022419999","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Irynx nods. \"That's the story.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:11:04.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879306742780010537","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Fear... and guilt. Because... that's not where it ended. That's just... the furthest I've been telling most people who ask about Katrine.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:11:45.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879306916369661962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"She turns to Orphy, who hops off the shoulder and moves to sit next to Sabrine's hand. `Take as much time as you need to tell.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:15:12.767000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879307785312022579","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she pets Orphy with her free hand. 'Thanks. It's... something I need to do.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:16:08.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879308019085762560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'See, the coyotes didn't kill her. They didn't even touch her. I scared them off before they could. I grabbed a gun from the cabin and shot at them.'\nshe stops petting Orphy, and takes her revolver, angling it so the words engraved on it can be read: *Katrine's Sorrow*.\n'I didn't hit any of the coyotes. But I hit Katrine.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:17:51.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879308450813861908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Ah.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:18:57.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879308729298870282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she nods, wiping tears from her eyes.","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:19:09.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879308778921676840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I ran away. I don't even remember if I waited for our parents.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:19:59.370000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879308987412136026","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'If I had stayed, perhaps I could have apprenticed at a temple in exchange for a raise dead spell... even if not, I wouldn't have abandoned her. But I did.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:21:02.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879309253893050418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"The other day, when we faced the wolf, you kept calling Secel Katrine...\" \n\"I understand.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:22:08.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879309528766742538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she nods. 'I got stuck in the past.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:22:27.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879309609402261545","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"800 years or 20 years, the past is still something to so easily get lost in.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:23:16.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879309812595326976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'It is. Especially when it all comes back at once. Leaving wasn't the only way I abandoned her.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:23:42.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879309924826488863","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I... sold my soul to... an eldritch ***Thing***, so that I could forget. I wouldn't be surprised if the ***Thing*** brought me back from the dead that first time, too, though of course I can't be sure.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:24:34.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879310139818147880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Gil saved me from, that, but he warned me about digging too deeply into my past... and I didn't listen. I--- dug into my memories - well, technically a couple of eels did it. Painful death, would not recommend. - and then I woke up after Gil brought me back, and I remembered.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:26:50.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879310711778582609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"That's my Memory is so strange, and so important. It's different to remember something, and to remember how something feels. That's where the story is.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:29:14.626000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879311316324597790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"You can spin a dozen different morals out of the same yarn. We're all just liars at heart, you know? But when someone tells you how they felt, their hopes and fears, that's the truth of things. That's where it hurts the worst.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:30:32.675000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T10:31:30.140000Z","id":"879311643685842984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'For a while, I... used it as another reason for self-loathing. Take a guess who helped me out of that one, too.' she can't help but laugh a little, though slightly strangely.","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:32:50.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879312220226478172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Kukudh?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:33:01.862000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879312269421469696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Well, I tried. But I can't take credit.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:33:09.461000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879312301293981747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Her death was... technically my fault. But at the same time, if I were still out there, they would have likely killed me protecting her, and left her defenseless. Or if I had run out with a weapon, either of those outcomes might have happened - I wasn't exactly trained.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:35:29.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879312889041788938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I did what I could in that moment... even if it doesn't feel like it. It's abandoning her afterwards I'm still struggling to forgive myself for.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:36:29.511000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879313140364509194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'But all I can do, is help others in her memory, and... see if I can find my old family, so I can at least apologise, give them a bit of closure.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:37:32.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879313404962148383","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"She smiles sadly. \"This fear and guilt that you have, that you wear like a heavy cloak; it's just that, and you can take it off someday. It is difficult to forgive yourself, but at some point you'll have to do that. I swear to you I will be here for you until you do.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:43:25.424000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T10:46:03.275000Z","id":"879314884830048348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Thank you. I'm... definitely doing better with it than I was a week or so ago.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:43:53.454000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879315002396381194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she goes to hug Irynx. 'You're like the big sister I never had. You know that?' she can't help but cry slightly.","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:47:02.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879315793664425984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Your family keeps growing with every day.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:50:21.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879316629387882496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I wouldn't call you little sister, even if age and size both have it. You're just.... *sister.*\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:52:18.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879317121744658433","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Size? I'm not that small, am I?' she puffs her cheeks out.","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:52:58.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879317289764257802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"despite it though, she's smiling. 'I couldn't ask for a better family than the one I have.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:53:23.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879317392562483200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Well, you're never going to ask. People are just gonna keep coming in and picking a branch on the family tree for them to sleep in.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:53:56.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879317533256204339","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"That is, unfortunately, how it works now.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:54:10.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879317589749272606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I mean, I'm not going to complain about it. If you told months-ago, fresh-from-the-grave me she'd have anything I now have, she wouldn't believe you.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:54:50.054000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879317756376412221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
